# Local working notes. These are gitignored, but that alone doesn't keep them out of the image —
# `COPY . .` takes whatever is on disk, so anything excluded from the repo has to be excluded
# here too or it ships to every user inside the container.
CLAUDE.md
MORNING.md
docs/dockerhub-description.md

# Nothing the running app needs; keeps the build context small and the image free of material
# that only matters to whoever is developing it.
